+
+`future_oracle.csv`-তে exact 62 item, requested নয়টি column; `anchors.json`, reproducible mining/collection/assessment/verification scripts, per-item search trails, inert source excerpts, patches, witness features, agreement ও proposal দেওয়া হয়েছে। পুনরায় চালানোর commands ও direction/confidence definitions `future_oracle/README.md`-এ। Input hashes, full-SHA locators, anchor maxima, positive predicate edits, unchanged Java trees, CWA annotation/404 semantics, coverage counts ও credential-output scan-এর ফল `future_oracle/verification.json` এবং `09_collab/logs/T41_scratch/`-এ।
+
+কোনো external code, upstream script, Docker, Java, Maven, build বা network চালানো হয়নি; শুধু whitelist করা read-only Git verbs ও আমাদের `/usr/bin/python3 -I -B` scripts। Blind package/key খোলা হয়নি; সব retrieval explicit input paths-এ সীমাবদ্ধ। Market README/HTML credential quote করা হয়নি; header values output হয়নি। Execution boundary: `mine_history.py:git`, script inputs ও output manifests; task constraint: `09_collab/tasks/T41.md`। একটি JSONL extraction bug ঠিক করা হয়েছে: Unicode line-separator ভাঙা ঠেকাতে `splitlines()`-এর বদলে `split("\n")`; পরে exact occurrence counts পাস করেছে (`collect_evidence.py:candidates`, `verification.json`)।
